              8 / 8-bit bytes                                    NAXIS   =                    2 / 2-dimensional binary table                     NAXIS1  =                   10 / width of table in bytes                        NAXIS2  =                   29 / number of rows in table                        PCOUNT  =                    0 / size of special data area                      GCOUNT  =                    1 / one data group (required keyword)              TFIELDS =                    3 / number of fields in each row                   TTYPE1  = 'YCOL    '           / Y-column                                       TFORM1  = 'I       '           / format of field                                TTYPE2  = 'CTI_Y   '           / CTI coefficient                                TFORM2  = 'E       '           / format of field                                TTYPE3  = 'CTI_Y_ERROR'        / error of CTI coefficient                       TFORM3  = 'E       '           / format of field                                EXTNAME = 'CTIY9   '           / parallel (Y) CTI                               ALGOID  =                    1 / argorithm identifyer                           SCALE   = 1.00000000000000E+00 / muliplicative scale factor of CTI values       END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            